// title: Entra Passkey Addition Threat Detection
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Entra
// tables: AuditLogs
// purpose: Entra Passkey Addition Threat Detection
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/Entra%20Passkey%20Addition%20Threat%20Detection.kql
